msgid ""
"The container commands below need [Ascend Docker "
"Runtime](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-ascend-docker-"
"runtime) on the **host**: it is the container engine's runtime, it reads "
"`ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES` and binds the selected devices into the container. "
"Without it the container starts with no NPU inside, so `npu-smi` reports no "
"device. Install and verify it once per host, as described in that section. "
"If you cannot install it on the host, use the device and driver flags in "
"[Manual device mapping without Ascend Docker "
"Runtime](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-container-"
"without-runtime)."
msgstr ""
"下方的容器命令需要在 **host**（宿主机）上安装 [Ascend Docker "
"Runtime](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-ascend-docker-"
"runtime)：它是容器引擎的运行时，会读取 "
"`ASCEND_VISIBLE_DEVICES`，并将选中的设备绑定到容器中。若没有它，容器启动时内部没有任何 NPU，因此 `npu-smi` "
"会报告无设备。请按照该章节所述，在每台宿主机上安装并验证一次。如果无法在宿主机上安装，请使用 [不使用 Ascend Docker Runtime "
"的手动设备映射](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-container-"
"without-runtime) 中的设备和驱动参数。"
